<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23200" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαιδάλ-εος</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ</span>] (not <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έος,</span> Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
			1.114
		</span></i>), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>:
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> δαιδάλλω</span>):— <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cunningly</i> or <i>curiously
				wrought,</i> in Hom.always of metal or wood, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζωστήρ, θώρηξ, σάκος, θρόνος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				4.135
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				8.195
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				19.380
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				1.131
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάρναξ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Simon.
					37.1
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				B.
				5.140
			</span></i>; also of embroidery, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				575
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hec.</u>
				470
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				Theopomp.Com.
				33
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of natural
			objects, <i>dappled, spotted,</i> etc., of fish, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				17
			</span></i>; of deer, <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				5.391
			</span></i>; <i>shot with light, sheeny,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				1.218
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>cunning,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χείρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Epigr.</u>
					22
				</span></i>
			:
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἥφαιστος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.755
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
